  unfold oddCompactScalarHeadPart3 oddCompactShiftedLowerSource oddCompactShiftedHeadLowPart3Grade4 oddCompactShiftedHeadLowPart3Grade5 oddCompactShiftedHeadLowPart3Grade6 oddCompactShiftedHeadLowPart3Grade7 oddCompactShiftedHeadLowPart3Grade8 oddCompactShiftedHeadLowPart3Grade9 oddCompactShiftedHeadLowPart3Grade10
